note a chatbot that lives on your own server and follows rules you write
when someone visits the path home do
show a heading with the words Chat with my bot
show a box called message
show a paragraph called reply with the words Say hello, ask for help, or say bye.
show a button with the words Send that asks the path talk and shows the reply in the paragraph called reply
reply with the page
end when
when someone visits the path talk do
let said be the visitor sent message
if said contains the words hello end words then
reply with the words Hello! Nice to meet you.
end if
if said contains the words help end words then
reply with the words I can say hello and bye. Try those!
end if
if said contains the words bye end words then
reply with the words Goodbye! Come back soon.
end if
reply with the words I did not understand that. Try saying hello.
end when
start the server on port 8094
